flowchart LR
    IN([Prompt]) --> PLAN[Plan, seven steps at most]
    PLAN -->|propose| PROP[[hoh_propose]]
    PROP --> BUILD[Build test first]
    BUILD --> PROBE[Probe edge cases]
    PROBE -->|freeze| FRZ[[hoh_freeze]]
    FRZ --> CHECK{Independent check}
    CHECK -- pass --> OUT([Accepted])
    CHECK -- fail --> FIX[Fix the cause]
    FIX --> BUILD
    CHECK -- three cycles --> ASK[Ask the user]
